1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,500
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,860 --> 00:00:12,060
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:18,020
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:22,260
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:27,820
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,500
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:35,140
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:39,500
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:44,340
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:48,780
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:53,360
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,540 --> 00:00:58,180
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:02,460
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,460 --> 00:01:08,860
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,340 --> 00:01:15,620
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:18,000
(1996)
Happy birthday, Boss Hui!

17
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:18,760
Cheers!

18
00:01:20,719 --> 00:01:21,480
Boss Hui.

19
00:01:22,359 --> 00:01:23,439
I came to see you.

20
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,359
Guys, you're here too.

21
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:30,799
Gold watch, huh? Looks like
you're doing pretty well.

22
00:01:30,799 --> 00:01:31,799
No, no.

23
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,120
It's just a knockoff.

24
00:01:33,359 --> 00:01:33,799
A knockoff.

25
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,359
Just for show.

26
00:01:35,599 --> 00:01:36,040
What's up?

27
00:01:36,719 --> 00:01:37,519
Oh, Boss Hui.

28
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:38,920
About that thing you mentioned
last time,

29
00:01:39,599 --> 00:01:40,840
I've found a buyer.

30
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:43,439
They're at the hotel next door.

31
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,879
Why don't we go talk to them?

32
00:01:47,879 --> 00:01:48,439
Alright.

33
00:01:49,359 --> 00:01:49,920
I'll go check it out.

34
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:51,799
Let's go.

35
00:01:51,799 --> 00:01:53,280
Boss Hui, I'll come with you.

36
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:54,760
No need.

37
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,439
He's one of us.

38
00:01:56,760 --> 00:01:58,159
It's fine. I'll be right back.

39
00:01:58,640 --> 00:01:59,159
You guys have fun.

40
00:01:59,239 --> 00:01:59,920
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

41
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:14,560
You like it?

42
00:02:15,159 --> 00:02:15,759
I do.

43
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:17,879
Here.

44
00:02:19,439 --> 00:02:20,560
Come on, Boss Hui. Let's go.

45
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:29,319
Go.

46
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,159
Boss Hui. Boss Hui.

47
00:02:32,319 --> 00:02:33,479
Someone wants you dead.

48
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,599
I didn't have a choice.

49
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:36,439
Don't blame me.

50
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:37,360
Take him.

51
00:02:37,919 --> 00:02:39,039
Go get Che.

52
00:02:39,439 --> 00:02:39,840
Okay.

53
00:02:45,840 --> 00:02:46,759
Our boss said

54
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:48,680
he wants to see how sincere you are.

55
00:03:03,319 --> 00:03:04,240
Nobody move!

56
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:07,759
A grenade!

57
00:03:08,800 --> 00:03:09,520
Wait! Wait!

58
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,280
Don't! Don't!

59
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,759
Don't do anything crazy!

60
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:13,639
I'll take all of you down with me.

61
00:03:15,439 --> 00:03:16,000
Don't move!

62
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:17,560
Boss Hui.

63
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:18,560
I'm fine.

64
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:22,719
What?

65
00:03:22,879 --> 00:03:24,039
You played me?

66
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:37,639
Lin!

67
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:46,840
Boss Hui!

68
00:03:47,039 --> 00:03:47,639
Boss Hui!

69
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:52,159
I'm fine.

70
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,319
Lin!

71
00:03:55,639 --> 00:03:56,240
Lin!

72
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,240
Lin!

73
00:03:58,639 --> 00:03:59,319
Lin!

74
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,439
Lin!

75
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:15,639
I had no choice.

76
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,639
Please, spare me!

77
00:04:18,879 --> 00:04:19,399
Boss Hui!

78
00:04:41,060 --> 00:04:43,860
=Episode 11=

79
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:46,480
(1999)
I got the quarantine certificate.

80
00:04:57,519 --> 00:04:58,360
We've got the certificate,

81
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,120
but something just occurred to me.

82
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:02,160
How are you going to make sure

83
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,199
the geese don't crap during transport?

84
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:03,669
And another thing.

85
00:05:03,670 --> 00:05:05,079
A goose's stomach puts a lot of pressure
on what's inside.

86
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,680
It could damage the gems.

87
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:14,290
What if we wrap the gems

88
00:05:14,800 --> 00:05:16,120
in something?

89
00:05:17,319 --> 00:05:18,040
Come on.

90
00:05:18,319 --> 00:05:19,920
A goose's stomach is
like a grinding wheel.

91
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,040
Wrapping them won't do any good.

92
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:22,800
The gems will come out in pieces.

93
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:24,879
Right.

94
00:05:25,399 --> 00:05:26,839
The coating can't be too hard,

95
00:05:27,079 --> 00:05:27,920
or it'll crack under pressure.

96
00:05:28,279 --> 00:05:29,199
But it can't be too soft either,

97
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,560
or it'll get digested.

98
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,920
I remember there's a kind of pill

99
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:36,319
that's coated in wax.

100
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:38,360
The wax is soft,

101
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:40,680
so it shouldn't get crushed or pass
right through, should it?

102
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,199
In theory...

103
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,079
it could work.

104
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:00,480
See, my brother.

105
00:06:01,319 --> 00:06:02,639
He was scared to death at first.

106
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:03,959
Look at him now.

107
00:06:09,079 --> 00:06:10,680
B-Boss Lin...

108
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,759
T-Tidao's side is already...

109
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:13,560
Boss Lin.

110
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,279
Everything's set on my end.

111
00:06:15,279 --> 00:06:16,439
When are we moving the shipment?

112
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,319
Get a batch of wax capsules.

113
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:20,279
We'll try moving a batch tonight.

114
00:06:20,279 --> 00:06:21,439
I'll ride with the shipment myself.

115
00:06:22,279 --> 00:06:23,120
I'll go with you.

116
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,920
Don't worry, Boss Che.

117
00:06:25,639 --> 00:06:26,920
Just stay here and hold down the fort.

118
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,720
What am I supposed to hold down here?

119
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:29,639
Make braised ducks?

120
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:30,680
Boss Che.

121
00:06:31,439 --> 00:06:32,519
They're geese.

122
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,639
Don't panic when we get there.

123
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:52,399
Whatever they ask for, give it to them.

124
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,079
Inspection.

125
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:57,879
Stop!

126
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,160
Hold up!

127
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:01,800
Step right there!

128
00:07:03,839 --> 00:07:04,519
Hands up!

129
00:07:05,120 --> 00:07:06,279
Geese. We're hauling geese.

130
00:07:06,519 --> 00:07:07,480
Ducks. Ducks.

131
00:07:07,839 --> 00:07:08,439
Don't move!

132
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:10,279
Hi, Sir.

133
00:07:11,199 --> 00:07:12,199
Money. Money.

134
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:14,680
More!

135
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,879
Boss Lin, he wants more money.

136
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:18,000
Okay.

137
00:07:23,360 --> 00:07:24,000
Money.

138
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,439
Okay. Let them go.

139
00:07:30,720 --> 00:07:31,240
Okay.

140
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:33,279
Thank you. Smoke?

141
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:43,560
Smoke.

142
00:07:51,839 --> 00:07:52,399
Thank you.

143
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:52,360
What?

144
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:53,840
Were you worried about me?

145
00:09:04,159 --> 00:09:04,600
Over there,

146
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:06,978
that's where my brother and I

147
00:09:06,979 --> 00:09:08,120
grew up.

148
00:09:10,559 --> 00:09:11,360
Do you want to take a look?

149
00:09:20,480 --> 00:09:21,559
I'm eating this one too.

150
00:09:22,759 --> 00:09:24,519
Sure. Eat.

151
00:09:24,519 --> 00:09:26,080
That's all you ever think about.

152
00:09:40,399 --> 00:09:40,960
Here.

153
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:44,919
Look.

154
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,480
This is where my brother and I lived

155
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,840
before we met you.

156
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:50,879
What do you think?

157
00:09:51,759 --> 00:09:52,679
Pretty run-down, huh?

158
00:09:56,879 --> 00:09:57,720
Look at these drawings.

159
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,759
My brother drew all of them.

160
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:01,919
He was really smart as a kid.

161
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:03,279
He did great in school too.

162
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,559
Then how did he...

163
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:11,240
He got really sick.

164
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,480
He had a high fever for three days.

165
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,480
We didn't have any money,

166
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:16,159
so he just had to tough it out.

167
00:10:16,519 --> 00:10:17,440
After the fever broke,

168
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,679
he was never quite the same.

169
00:10:20,200 --> 00:10:21,720
I was only four or five back then.

170
00:10:22,759 --> 00:10:23,519
And our parents were gone too.

171
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:31,159
That's all in the past now.

172
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,639
Yeah.

173
00:10:36,200 --> 00:10:36,919
It's in the past.

174
00:10:37,600 --> 00:10:39,080
Besides, I met you after that.

175
00:10:41,639 --> 00:10:42,279
Idiot.

176
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:43,919
You're the idiot.

177
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:46,879
Let's go.

178
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:53,919
Idiot.

179
00:10:56,559 --> 00:10:57,440
To tell you the truth,

180
00:10:58,159 --> 00:10:59,879
our businesses haven't been
doing too well lately.

181
00:11:00,919 --> 00:11:02,399
But yours are booming, Boss Hui.

182
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:03,759
You're pulling in serious money.

183
00:11:05,200 --> 00:11:06,759
It's all thanks to the guys.

184
00:11:08,279 --> 00:11:10,440
Boss Hui takes care of his own.

185
00:11:10,759 --> 00:11:11,720
That's why so many people stand
behind him.

186
00:11:12,559 --> 00:11:13,519
Che and Lin,

187
00:11:13,519 --> 00:11:14,799
the best of the younger generation,

188
00:11:14,799 --> 00:11:15,720
are backing you too.

189
00:11:15,919 --> 00:11:16,600
Exactly.

190
00:11:17,919 --> 00:11:18,960
So...

191
00:11:20,679 --> 00:11:22,200
are you guys having any trouble
right now?

192
00:11:33,360 --> 00:11:34,919
I know you've got your own problems.

193
00:11:35,919 --> 00:11:37,200
But anyone willing to lend me a hand

194
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:38,360
is a true friend of mine.

195
00:11:39,759 --> 00:11:41,000
I'd go through fire for you.

196
00:11:41,919 --> 00:11:42,720
Boss Hui, this...

197
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:45,759
Thanks.

198
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,080
Have some tea.

199
00:11:47,080 --> 00:11:48,159
Here. Thanks, Boss Hui.

200
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,279
Have some tea.

201
00:11:49,879 --> 00:11:50,480
Thanks.

202
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:57,000
By the time the shipment
reached the goose farm,

203
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:58,320
some of the wax capsules
had already melted.

204
00:12:04,919 --> 00:12:06,099
Even where the wax had melted,

205
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:07,279
the jewelry was fine.

206
00:12:07,679 --> 00:12:09,360
(Dongcheng White Horse)
Didn't we weigh

207
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:11,039
the wax capsules

208
00:12:11,039 --> 00:12:12,399
and the jewelry together
before shipping?

209
00:12:12,879 --> 00:12:15,200
We'll calculate how long
each trip takes,

210
00:12:15,679 --> 00:12:16,840
then see how much wax

211
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,679
is left after each trip.

212
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:21,519
Based on the travel time
and the amount of wax left,

213
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,960
we increase the thickness
of the wax proportionally.

214
00:12:24,279 --> 00:12:25,759
That should keep the jewelry safe.

215
00:12:26,200 --> 00:12:27,000
You get what I mean?

216
00:12:27,559 --> 00:12:28,120
Got it.

217
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:29,639
Then explain it back to me.

218
00:12:31,279 --> 00:12:32,000
Never mind.

219
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:35,840
Just tell me this.

220
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:37,879
Will this plan work or not?

221
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:39,559
This idea of yours

222
00:12:40,799 --> 00:12:41,200
will work.

223
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:42,879
Good enough for me.

224
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:44,559
Then you guys

225
00:12:44,559 --> 00:12:46,000
move the whole shipment tonight.

226
00:12:46,600 --> 00:12:47,360
Got it. Boss Lin.

227
00:12:47,679 --> 00:12:49,440
Go. Go.

228
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:53,919
You think they understood any of that?

229
00:12:55,120 --> 00:12:55,559
Not my problem.

230
00:12:55,559 --> 00:12:56,360
I didn't understand it either.

231
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:11,480
T-That guy...

232
00:13:11,919 --> 00:13:13,000
I've never seen him before.

233
00:13:13,159 --> 00:13:13,799
It's fine.

234
00:13:14,120 --> 00:13:15,240
The goods are out and the money's in.

235
00:13:15,559 --> 00:13:16,159
Everything's good.

236
00:13:16,399 --> 00:13:17,159
Don't worry.

237
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,600
A new face...

238
00:13:23,639 --> 00:13:24,440
There are horizontal ones,

239
00:13:24,919 --> 00:13:25,720
and vertical ones.

240
00:13:25,919 --> 00:13:27,159
I don't know them.

241
00:13:27,879 --> 00:13:29,039
You need to learn.

242
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,320
This is fun. They're all numbers
from one to nine.

243
00:13:32,799 --> 00:13:35,799
I only know one to five.

244
00:13:38,919 --> 00:13:39,559
Look at this.

245
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:40,919
Hello?

246
00:13:41,399 --> 00:13:41,919
This means...

247
00:13:43,759 --> 00:13:44,440
Know what it means?

248
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,759
Okay. I'll go find him.

249
00:13:46,639 --> 00:13:46,960
What's wrong?

250
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:48,159
Let's go, Che.

251
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:51,679
Boss Hui's wife said
it's Mei's birthday today.

252
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,440
They were supposed
to take a family photo.

253
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:54,919
She can't get hold of Boss Hui.

254
00:13:55,559 --> 00:13:56,360
No way.

255
00:13:56,879 --> 00:13:58,360
Boss Hui would never miss
Mei's birthday.

256
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,156
Fu, after you're done eating,

257
00:13:59,300 --> 00:13:59,840
go straight home, okay?

258
00:13:59,840 --> 00:14:00,720
Don't wander off.

259
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:02,080
Lin...

260
00:14:03,919 --> 00:14:04,759
Che...

261
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:09,240
Boss Hui.

262
00:14:09,240 --> 00:14:10,039
Move!

263
00:14:10,639 --> 00:14:11,320
Boss Hui.

264
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:12,279
(Keep Your Honor and Justice. Integrity.
Be Loyal and Filial. Propriety.)

265
00:14:12,279 --> 00:14:13,159
Everybody stop!

266
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:24,440
I, Shuangdao Hui,

267
00:14:25,279 --> 00:14:26,440
own what I do.

268
00:14:27,759 --> 00:14:28,679
But Boss Hai's death...

269
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:30,879
had nothing to do with me.

270
00:14:33,279 --> 00:14:34,480
I have proof.

271
00:14:37,919 --> 00:14:40,600
You're the one who killed Boss Hai.

272
00:14:45,980 --> 00:14:47,060
(Call Records Report)

273
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:47,600
This

274
00:14:48,159 --> 00:14:50,039
is Boss Hai's call record.

275
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:52,360
The last call he made

276
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,679
was to you.

277
00:14:55,519 --> 00:14:56,480
And the call was made

278
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:57,879
exactly two hours

279
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,360
after Boss Hai

280
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:00,639
left the fishing boat.

281
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:01,679
Am I right?

282
00:15:04,080 --> 00:15:04,799
That's right.

283
00:15:07,159 --> 00:15:07,759
Here.

284
00:15:07,759 --> 00:15:08,320
Bring it over.

285
00:15:14,759 --> 00:15:17,080
Is this shipment yours?

286
00:15:19,000 --> 00:15:20,080
Yes.

287
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:28,879
You've been hiding drugs inside jewelry.

288
00:15:29,639 --> 00:15:30,759
Boss Hai found out.

289
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:31,720
You were afraid

290
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:34,480
you'd be disqualified
from the shot-caller election,

291
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,039
so you made your move

292
00:15:37,799 --> 00:15:39,159
and killed Boss Hai.

293
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:42,799
The shipment is mine,

294
00:15:43,279 --> 00:15:44,799
but I knew nothing about the drugs.

295
00:15:45,799 --> 00:15:48,200
I've been running with a blade
since I was sixteen.

296
00:15:49,039 --> 00:15:50,879
Everyone in the underworld
knows who I am.

297
00:15:51,360 --> 00:15:53,519
But I'm not some common street thug.

298
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:55,279
I don't touch drugs.

299
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:57,279
And I don't make money by ruining lives.

300
00:15:58,279 --> 00:15:58,919
Fei Liu.

301
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:03,399
You say Boss Hai found out
Boss Hui was trafficking drugs.

302
00:16:04,039 --> 00:16:04,639
Where's the proof?

303
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:07,759
This bag of lousy jewelry?

304
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,200
Everyone knows

305
00:16:09,879 --> 00:16:11,240
you want Tai to take the top spot.

306
00:16:11,639 --> 00:16:12,720
You're pulling this stunt now

307
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,679
to clear the way for Tai, aren't you?

308
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:15,720
Am I right?

309
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:16,440
Isn't that what this is?

310
00:16:17,919 --> 00:16:18,840
Fine. Fine.

311
00:16:21,759 --> 00:16:22,799
This piece of jewelry

312
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:23,994
was something I found

313
00:16:23,995 --> 00:16:26,279
among Boss Hai's belongings.

314
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:28,799
Is that jewelry yours?

315
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:31,919
There are still drugs inside it.

316
00:16:35,000 --> 00:16:35,720
Boss Hai

317
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:37,639
knew you were the traitor.

318
00:16:38,440 --> 00:16:39,320
That's why he was investigating you.

319
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:40,639
So,

320
00:16:41,279 --> 00:16:42,320
you decided to silence him

321
00:16:42,879 --> 00:16:44,000
and killed Boss Hai.

322
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:46,480
What?

323
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:49,879
I checked this shipment myself.

324
00:16:50,279 --> 00:16:51,320
There couldn't have been
any drugs in it.

325
00:16:54,519 --> 00:16:55,120
Yong.

326
00:16:56,519 --> 00:16:57,840
Boss Hui was with Boss Hai
for twenty years.

327
00:16:58,639 --> 00:16:59,840
He'd never kill Boss Hai.

328
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:02,799
Kid,

329
00:17:03,279 --> 00:17:04,160
you're too naive.

330
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:07,039
When the top seat is at stake,

331
00:17:07,480 --> 00:17:10,640
what's twenty years
of brotherhood worth?

332
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:11,559
How dare you, Fei Liu!

333
00:17:13,580 --> 00:17:14,860
(Loyalty Hall)
